## 16. INTEGRATION WITH EXISTING COUNT-BASED ATTENDANCE

The existing application already supports count-based team attendance and weekly calculations.

Do not remove or break that system.

Support two attendance methods:

1. Count-based team attendance.
2. Individual labourer GPS attendance.

The authorized admin must configure the attendance method for each applicable team/project or reporting arrangement.

Avoid double-counting.

If a team uses individual labourer attendance, do not also count those same workers through a count-based attendance entry for the same work period unless an explicitly configured reconciliation process permits it.

Create a reconciliation mechanism to detect:

- Workers counted individually and in a team total.
- Duplicate attendance for the same worker and work period.
- Inconsistent team assignments.
- Missing checkouts.
- Attendance recorded against the wrong worksite.

Historical count-based records must remain unchanged.

