- Use HTTPS for all location-related operations.
- Request location permission only when the user performs an attendance action or responds to a verification request.
- Do not continuously track users.
- Restrict location access by role and assignment.
- Do not expose full Aadhaar information in APIs or frontend responses unless specifically required and authorized.
